================ Installation guide =======================

[MUST DO!]
You must install the belows.
- CAENUSBdrvB-1.5.2 
- CAENVMELib-2.50
- CAENComm-1.2
- CAENDigitizer_2.11.0
These have "Readme" files which describe the installation.

[Connect to DAQ]
type "lsusb" and you can show this line.

Bus 001 Device 009: ID 21e1:0000 CAEN CAEN DT5xxx USB 1.0

and type " ./execute_DAQ -j " (it is run DAQ script)

===========================================================

[Data taking path]
/home/precalkor/ADC/ADC_test

[Data storage]
/home/precalkor/Data ==> symbolic link in ./ADC_test/Data

[Data taking]
==> Self trigger
./execute_DAQ -c 00000001 -o /home/precalkor/Data/self_hvxxxx.0001 -r -d 512 -n 10000 -y 1 -f
	
==> External trigger
./execute_DAQ -c 00000001 -o /home/precalkor/Data/Dark/external_hvxxxx.0001 -r -d 512 -n 10000 -y 1 -e 

*if you want to more detail, then you should read the ADC_test_jk.cpp in /home/ADC/ADC_test/ 
(in this Directory)

[Source code path]
/home/precalkor/ADC/ADC_test/ADC_test_jk.cpp ==> You can fix it. And You should be make.


